    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si hoc de mundi amatoribus et in terrena cupiditate manen­ tibus recte et non immerito credatur, indubitanter rectius de sacerdotum personis sentitur, si discor­ dantibus volis ac studiis inter se dividi comproben­ tur.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Aut qua fiducia Conditori nostro qui nos in uni­ tate compagis, quod est corpus suæ deitatis, vivere præcepit, preces oblaturi sumus, si nos vicissim a mutua charitate seponimus?",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut quodam loco deificus sermo docet, studere nos convenit ut frater fratri adjuvans, sicut civitas munita et fortis , inconcusso fundamine stare possit;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "scilicet ut unius fratris mœ­ stitiæ omnes aequanimiter compatiendo participemus, mutuisque nos laboribus sublevemus.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Pro qua re, piissime ac multum diligende domine et frater, indi­ camus nos litteras filii nostri domini regis Theode­ baldi excepisse,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut in Tullensiom urbe die calenda­ rum iuniarum adesse deberem, nullam causam evo­ cationis declarantes.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Reciprocante pagina indicavi­ mus nos illuc accedere non debere, quia causam conditionemque nos constabat ignorare.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Iteratis scriptis edocuit beatitudinem vestram I dum aliquos Francorum pro zelo divini timoris corripit, ac pro incestis conditionibus a communione ecclesiastica removet, scandala seu anxietates multimodas susti­ nere.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De qua re non mediocriter ingemiscimus, quod nos relatione vestra scire non feceritis, utrum ex canouica lectione damnentur, an pro pastorali dili­ genlia de mediocribus reatibus corrigantur.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Licet nihil novi vos de his rebus invenire posse cognosci­ mus , quod prisca Patrum solertia non potuit repe­ rire;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "tamen absurdum esse videtur ut a nobis reci­ piantur qui a vobis secundum seriem canonum ec­ clesiastica severitate abdicantur.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Novimus enim , si scienter hoc gerimus, quod criminibus aliorum mis­ ceamur; si ignoranter, reatui non subdamur.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qua­ propter salutantes charitate debita indicamus, simul­ que suademus ut nos in omnibus participes tam tri- bulationum vestrarum incommodis quam prosperita­ tum commodis fieri studeatis.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam nos, mediante capite nostro quod est Christus, nullis adversitatibus a vestra anxietate divellimur, nullisque asperitatibus a vestra charitate dividimur.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De qua re si tamen præsumptiosi non existimus, indicare præsumimus.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann#PL68.ANN.5.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/mappinius-remensis/pl68_2_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL68.ANN.5.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Decuerat ut vestra consolatio, pro hujusmodi condi­ tionibus potius quam regiae vocationis, nos conserere debuisset;",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 542,
    "date_range": [
      535,
      550
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
